1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:08,135
After a very, very long day, you are very sleepy

2
00:00:08,135 --> 00:00:16,950
and you decide that it is time to go to bed, to sleep.

3
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:23,240
Then you lie down on the bed close your eyes.

4
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:29,466
And each time you feel heavier and heavier.

5
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:35,470
Each time it's harder and harder to open them.

6
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:42,515
Little by little sleep is consuming you.

7
00:00:42,515 --> 00:00:50,000
And when you open your eyes again, you are in the open air.

8
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:58,200
You look up above you see the blue sky.

9
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:02,259
There is not a single cloud.

10
00:01:02,259 --> 00:01:07,430
It's clear, clear.

11
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:17,571
And when you look ahead, you see everything, everything, everything is yellow.

12
00:01:18,151 --> 00:01:21,814
It is yellow because of the wheat.

13
00:01:22,185 --> 00:01:27,671
You are in the middle of a wheat field.

14
00:01:27,671 --> 00:01:34,310
And the wheat goes up to over your head.

15
00:01:35,394 --> 00:01:46,415
You are alone in the middle of a wheat field, there is nothing else around you.

16
00:01:46,721 --> 00:01:57,095
Then you decide to walk a little, forward to see if you discover something.

17
00:01:57,300 --> 00:02:00,113
You breathe ...

18
00:02:02,361 --> 00:02:13,998
deeply and enjoy the oxygen and the pure air that is in the field, in the wheat field.

19
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:19,167
You keep walking and walking.

20
00:02:19,380 --> 00:02:23,495
Your feet carry you alone.

21
00:02:23,495 --> 00:02:27,453
One step, another step.

22
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:36,546
Little by little you are advancing and you are making your way in the wheat field.

23
00:02:37,043 --> 00:02:49,798
When you do not want to continue walking you jump to try to see what is around you.

24
00:02:49,990 --> 00:02:57,422
And in the distance, in the distance you see a house.

25
00:02:58,151 --> 00:03:14,318
It is a small house that appears to have two stories and is made of gray brick with a red roof.

26
00:03:15,839 --> 00:03:23,012
Next to the house there is a row of green pine trees.

27
00:03:23,568 --> 00:03:29,751
All lined up and forming a path.

28
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:40,822
You decide to walk in the opposite direction to the house, to see if you find something else.

29
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:46,310
And you keep making your way through the wheat.

30
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:52,909
You only see the blue of the sky and the yellow of the wheat.

31
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:59,102
Until then you come to a clearing.

32
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:07,344
There is no more wheat, but in front of you there is a grape.

33
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:13,494
It is a huge, huge grape.

34
00:04:13,494 --> 00:04:18,000
Very large, and it's green.

35
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:29,887
The grape is so large that it could perfectly be a three-story building.

36
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:38,690
You decide to explore what is in the grape and surround it.

37
00:04:38,690 --> 00:04:45,936
You touch it with your hand, it has a soft texture.

38
00:04:45,936 --> 00:04:57,258
You surround the grape until suddenly you come across some stairs.

39
00:04:57,445 --> 00:05:02,471
You climb the stairs little by little.

40
00:05:02,471 --> 00:05:08,411
One by one, counting them in your head.

41
00:05:08,562 --> 00:05:09,984
One ...

42
00:05:10,374 --> 00:05:12,111
Two ...

43
00:05:12,111 --> 00:05:13,860
Three ...

44
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:19,136
And so on until you get to the top.

45
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:29,020
And once you have reached the top you are panting.

46
00:05:30,482 --> 00:05:40,934
You stop for a moment to catch your breath and put your hands on your knees.

47
00:05:41,490 --> 00:05:50,027
When you open your eyes again you see a pool of grape juice.

48
00:05:51,400 --> 00:06:04,469
You take advantage and take off your shirt and jump head first into the pool of grape juice.

49
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:09,387
The grape juice is cool, cool, cool.

50
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:18,509
And since it is a hot day, after a walk it is wonderful.

51
00:06:19,073 --> 00:06:25,275
You lie on the grape juice, relaxing.

52
00:06:25,340 --> 00:06:37,230
And as you relax, you look up at the blue sky and see a single cloud, moving.

53
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:47,108
Slowly, with the wind that is blowing little, little, little.

54
00:06:47,837 --> 00:06:52,123
You keep swimming, in the grape.

55
00:06:52,123 --> 00:07:00,921
And when you're done, you go out and tie your shirt around your waist.

56
00:07:01,311 --> 00:07:10,895
You leave the grape and go back to walking among the wheat.

57
00:07:11,810 --> 00:07:15,694
To see what else you discover.

58
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:20,640
When you re-enter the wheat field,

59
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:28,246
the wheat under your feet creaks again with each step you take.

60
00:07:28,246 --> 00:07:38,308
And after the refreshing bath that you have taken in the grape juice, it seems that it is not so hot anymore.

61
00:07:38,778 --> 00:07:46,856
The sun hits your back, it hits your shoulders and hits your head.

62
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:49,820
But you no longer feel hot.

63
00:07:50,251 --> 00:08:03,874
In fact now there is a gentle breeze that keeps you walking and walking and walking.

64
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:16,533
I hope that you are already asleep and that you have a sweet dream.

65
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:23,089
Do tell me what other things you can find in the wheat field.

66
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:25,335
Goodnight.